From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 16:23:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tapback: add options to disable multi-queue

Add the -q option to disable multi-queue for all the VBDs. It can also be
set in the TAPBACK_OPTS variable of /etc/sysconfig/tapback.

Multi-queue can also be disabled for a single VBD, by writing
multi-queue-max-queues=1 in its back-end. This requires the XAPI to pass
it from the VBD other-config.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
